exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__dev_strateg_export_products_laravel_boost__record_rule(args: {
  // Glob for the files this rule applies to, for example "app/Http/Controllers/**" or "app/Models/*.php". This routes the rule into a shared area file and is how agents find it later.
  glob: string;
  // A few lines stating the rule plainly. No essays.
  note: string;
  // A short, specific heading, for example "Extend BaseController for tenant scoping".
