## Listening to browser events

You can also listen for browser events dispatched from JavaScript:

```php
#[On('user-logged-in')]
public function handleUserLogin()
{
    // Handle login...
}
```

```javascript
// From JavaScript
window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('user-logged-in'));
```

