## Tables 02 Columns 01 Overview Setting a default sort option label
Tables 02 Columns 01 Overview | filament/filament@5.x | Source: https://github.com/filamentphp/filament/blob/5.x/packages/tables/docs/02-columns/01-overview.md

### Setting a default sort option label

To set a default sort option label, use the `defaultSortOptionLabel()` method:

```php
use Filament\Tables\Table;

public function table(Table $table): Table
{
    return $table
        ->columns([
            // ...
        ])
        ->defaultSortOptionLabel('Date');
}
```

